Emmanuelle,

One can accomplish this by combining the plotReftoTarget function plus an additional ‘points’ call to superimpose the landmarks for the specimen you want.  Below is an example:

data(plethodon)

Y.gpa <- gpagen(plethodon$land)    #GPA-alignment

ref <- mshape(Y.gpa$coords)

P <- plotRefToTarget(ref, Y.gpa$coords[,,1], method = "vector")

points(Y.gpa$coords[,,1], pch = 21, bg = "red")

Best,

Dean

