Ps. I also encourage you start using JSON format for your pointList (or other Markups) objects in Slicer instead of FCSV. fcsv is being phased out, and you will not get the additional benefits of landmarks states (editing, done, missing, etc) or new features that will be added to the Markups objects. The sooner you make the transition, the fewer datasets you will have that you have to worry about later.

